OL,3,GNEWSADecision expected on future of A5
OL,4,Aupgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Court of Appeal is expected to make
OL,7,Fa decision on the future of the
OL,8,Flong-delayed A5 upgrade project on
OL,9,FTuesday.
OL,11,FProposals to build a new dual dual
OL,12,Fcarriageway between Londonderry and
OL,13,FAughnacloy go back almost 20 years but
OL,14,Fhave been beset by funding and legal
OL,15,Fissues.
OL,17,FLast year, a court ruled the Department
OL,18,Ffor Infrastructure's (DfI) plans for
OL,19,Fthe road did not comply with climate
OL,20,Ftargets. It was the third time in 18
OL,21,Fyears that approval for the road has
OL,22,Fbeen overturned in court.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
